            },
            {
              "startIndex": 4062,
              "endIndex": 4447,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 4062,
                    "endIndex": 4447,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Figure 1. Match rate by round with the model's own history. Left to right: Qwen3.8-27B under the V4 prompt (learns); the same model under a reworded prompt (Arm P1, still learns); Gemma-4-31B under the identical design (Arm R1, flat); the same Qwen forced to state a probability per message before choosing (Arm E1, flat). Dashed: V4 no-history reference. Grey band: held-out wording.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "italic": true,
                        "fontSize": {
                          "magnitude": 12,
                          "unit": "PT"
                        },
                        "weightedFontFamily": {
                          "fontFamily": "Times New Roman",
                          "weight": 400
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
